# Powershell Keylogging | T1056.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_keylogging.yml
ScriptBlockText="*Get-Keystrokes*" OR (ScriptBlockText="*Get-ProcAddress user32.dll GetAsyncKeyState*" ScriptBlockText="*Get-ProcAddress user32.dll GetForegroundWindow*")
